   "k": "title",
   "mood": "dreamy ambient"
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "A simulated Dallas, where the clock always reads 6:41. In a vast warehouse, workers sit in rows at screens. The Ranger Walker has broken in, with a hacker's voice in his head.",
