  {
   "k": "intro",
   "who": "WALKER"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "WALKER",
   "text": "This ain’t oil.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep17/v03.wav",
   "d": 1.425,
   "e": "000000jxomitzzvkqvzzvqmif900000000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "JOHNNY SILVER-SOUL",
   "text": "Nah, partner. It’s worse. It’s engagement metrics.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep17/v04.wav",
   "d": 3.15,
   "e": "000xzvayyszxrpzzvmmryzxzwxvvwhsikh000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "intro",
   "who": "SUSAN"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "SUSAN",
   "text": "Sir… are you… management?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep17/v06.wav",
   "d": 2.45,
   "e": "00009qxzyudryvpvqn700vzxyzvonojjd0000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "WALKER",
   "text": "No ma’am. I’m… maintenance.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep17/v07.wav",
   "d": 2.175,
   "e": "0000kzzxxzxxtmmzxqfoxxshmpkbfkd000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "WALKER",
   "text": "Susan. What do you think this place is?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep17/v08.wav",
   "d": 2.475,
   "e": "0004szvszuqzztvspvisd3vxqgopkab200000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "SUSAN",
   "text": "It’s Dallas. We’re doing honest work. We’re… building the future.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep17/v09.wav",
   "d": 4.375,
   "e": "00nwoywsnuuzxtxthre60bzxm00rzxzmunmb0000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "WALKER",
   "text": "What are you mining?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep17/v10.wav",
   "d": 1.45,
   "e": "000000kzsxqtwvxzzwvrrnii8a70000000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "SUSAN",
   "text": "Data.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep17/v11.wav",
   "d": 1.375,
   "e": "00000000000juzzyzuyywssq9000000000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "WALKER",
   "text": "What is data?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep17/v12.wav",
   "d": 1.425,
   "e": "000000fwzsztoi0uzxwvqtrle910000000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "SUSAN",
   "text": "It’s… information.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep17/v13.wav",
   "d": 1.875,
   "e": "0000006zzkhql9ezzpvyyvurolpmjj5000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "WALKER",
   "text": "And what is information for?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep17/v14.wav",
   "d": 2.05,
   "e": "0000pxxvzyzpyucwxzwrqtsb9stpi60000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "SUSAN",
   "text": "It’s for… the company?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep17/v15.wav",
   "d": 1.975,
   "e": "000000zwsuduyzxsk0rtjrzxhuolji9000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "WALKER",
   "text": "And who’s the company?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep17/v16.wav",
   "d": 1.75,
   "e": "00000tzvqqzyuonxdlzzt2xtrmic000000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "JOHNNY SILVER-SOUL",
   "text": "Careful, cowboy. You’re asking questions in a world built on answers.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep17/v17.wav",
   "d": 4.175,
   "e": "00czsvnyxyugwzyozhxnxxwvzvnyswxvohi00000"
  },
  {
   "k": "chorus",
   "ask": "I never really asked who it was all for",
   "who": "A CITIZEN",
   "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/5b892d7d-b03e-58e2-93e7-9d66c71e2a58/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/c6c34983-ace7-5c6a-9666-9ca7673af632.mp4",
   "in": 18.28,
   "d": 4.11,
   "said": "So we were there for all the banks and we were there for all the people.",
   "src": "Inside the Fed",
   "y": 1994
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "WALKER",
   "text": "You’re in a cave. A room where they show you shadows and call it life. These screens are the wall. The work is the chain.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep17/v19.wav",
   "d": 7.4,
   "e": "0yzhytvzyysysvupnxpu50ptvzsuytnwpmopb000"
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "A drone descends from the ceiling: the system's courtesy check. Asked what this place is, it pauses a moment too long, then answers. Dallas. Honest work.",
   "see": [
    {
     "place": "p1a"
    },
    "a camera hanging from a ceiling"
   ],
   "mood": "tension and suspense",
   "wav": "pilot/ep17/v20.wav",
   "d": 11.175,
   "e": "0zyyxxzouxxywxh0yvxyvtyzzxzxywp0wvbzwr00",
   "shots": [
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/761d4e3e-3e59-549e-855c-421ffeb03c30/v3-ffmpeg-openclip-1/clips/e6196377-9079-53f7-8598-43eeb66740fe.mp4",
     "in": 1.0,
     "src": "The Mission of Apollo / Soyuz, ca. 1975",
     "y": null,
     "q": "p1a"
    },
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/93b37710-b241-51a8-ac5a-dc385a45b1c2/v3-ffmpeg-openclip-1/clips/4dce9e0f-a669-5cb3-9734-418d6ee77824.mp4",
     "in": 0.0,
     "dur": 10.91,
     "src": "RCA Presentation: Television, An",
     "y": 1939,
     "q": "a camera hanging from a ceiling",
     "fit": 0.293
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "WALKER",
   "text": "No. It’s a server. And they’re batteries.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep17/v21.wav",
   "d": 2.575,
   "e": "000hxyxxgtnnyzoup30tyzqxzvqokfcc00000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "The drone calls this unlicensed advocacy and arms its gun. Justice, it says, is the advantage of the stronger. Walker kicks it out of the air, into a shower of sparks.",
   "see": [
    "sparks flying from a broken machine",
    "a man kicking high"
   ],
   "mood": "something breaking apart",
   "wav": "pilot/ep17/v22.wav",
   "d": 12.15,
   "e": "0zvxuyutuuvwsv8pwpwvtzxwsxh7zsxxvuxxrqh0",
   "shots": [
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/25ec4d83-569e-5375-9ab9-e699026c4b9e/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/877940e1-b51e-5d15-9e8b-535249dff1f8.mp4",
     "in": 0.0,
     "dur": 11.21,
     "src": "Welding Operator, The",
     "y": 1942,
     "q": "sparks flying from a broken machine",
     "fit": 0.369
    },
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/4306bdcc-699b-538a-8cbe-cd91ea45b687/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/aa68e81d-4b09-5585-99a8-506da7a59817.mp4",
     "in": 0.0,
     "dur": 5.74,
     "src": "[Amateur films: Ivan Besse collection: Britton, South Dakota",
     "y": 1938,
     "q": "a man kicking high",
     "fit": 0.295
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "SUSAN",
   "text": "We’re… not supposed to do that.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep17/v23.wav",
   "d": 2.35,
   "e": "00000nzzzxq70kxylsskxskqlwvoumj4c0000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "WALKER",
   "text": "No. You’re not supposed to see that you can.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep17/v24.wav",
   "d": 2.625,
   "e": "000jxzvszyzflnqzqdmkuuvgqkcrqkd800000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "Walker grips the locked warehouse door and asks what lies outside. A worker answers without thinking: freedom.",
   "see": [
    "a large locked warehouse door",
    "a hand on a door handle"
   ],
   "mood": "quiet calm",
   "wav": "pilot/ep17/v25.wav",
   "d": 7.825,
   "e": "0zwykykxwrxpuwotxwoxm00xzvqvvxqxtg9zp200",
   "shots": [
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/dordrecht/clips/0000103440-0000133320.mp4",
     "in": 0.0,
     "dur": 29.88,
     "src": "Dordrecht",
     "y": 1926,
     "q": "a large locked warehouse door",
     "fit": 0.273
    },
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/dcd9fd10-8196-5f4b-acd6-2050942b4e7b/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/e3884370-cf34-5486-b6b8-f8363077decd.mp4",
     "in": 1.0,
     "dur": 4.3,
     "src": "Safety: Harm Hides at Home",
     "y": null,
     "q": "a hand on a door handle",
     "fit": 0.361
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "WALKER",
   "text": "And if it isn’t freedom?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep17/v26.wav",
   "d": 1.775,
   "e": "00000uyzz9zovzqxtbdbxxxmwpkf600000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "SUSAN",
   "text": "…Then it’s… the real world?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep17/v27.wav",
   "d": 2.2,
   "e": "00000pqzzyuwhsrf0qwrxzywqwroijf200000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "WALKER",
   "text": "And if the real world is worse than this?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep17/v28.wav",
   "d": 2.6,
   "e": "000lvx4xpvzyptzzvfnmgqzum7qpkcff10000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "SUSAN",
   "text": "Then… why leave?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep17/v29.wav",
   "d": 1.925,
   "e": "0000000lxzzzywm000lzyvqusmkgfg4000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "JOHNNY SILVER-SOUL",
   "text": "That’s the trick, Walker. They don’t cage you with bars. They cage you with comparisons.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep17/v30.wav",
   "d": 4.5,
   "e": "00wttpzqzxvvyvvxxusztm3vtzwyqvwyroh90000"
  },
  {
   "k": "chorus",
   "ask": "at least here we know where we stand",
   "who": "A CITIZEN",
   "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/how-do-you-know-it-s-love/clips/0000623923-0000635034.mp4",
   "in": 5.86,
   "d": 2.15,
   "said": "But what about us?",
   "src": "How Do You Know It's Love?",
   "y": 1950
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "WALKER",
   "text": "Because it’s yours. Even if it’s ugly. Even if it’s cold. This is a shadow on a server wall. And you’re worth more than somebody else’s electricity.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep17/v32.wav",
   "d": 9.675,
   "e": "0vtzyuyvvwqytux51zxxsvywyiwzwztvupspn700"
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "Then Susan reaches out and turns her terminal off. A crack opens in the air above the workers. Through it: red desert, and real stars.",
